summary:
Strong Consumer Spending Start to 2022 Continued in February;

Suggests More Normalized Spending Heading into Spring

CHARLOTTE, N.C., March 8, 2022 /PRNewswire/ -- Bank of America today announced their approximately 67 million clients made $294 billion in total payments during February, a 16% increase over February 2021. This follows a 5% increase in total payments in February 2021 when compared to pre-pandemic levels in February 2020. This marks a continuation of the strong consumer payments a
